OL,3,GNEWSALocal heroes honoured at Make a
OL,4,ADifference Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople who make life better for others
OL,7,Fhave been honoured at this year's BBC
OL,8,FRadio York Make a Difference Awards.
OL,10,FThe awards were set up during the Covid
OL,11,Fpandemic to recognise the efforts of
OL,12,Funsung heroes.
OL,14,FEight winners from the region were
OL,15,Fcelebrated at the ceremony, including a
OL,16,F90-year-old table tennis player, a
OL,17,Ffirefighting farmer and an organ
OL,18,Frecipient who represented Team GB.
OL,20,FThe awards were presented by BBC Radio
OL,21,FYork's Georgey Spanswick and Joanita
OL,22,FMusisi at York Racecourse.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
